{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:08 2026-11-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:08 2026-11-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:08 2026-11-09 HKT</p><img alt=\"方嘉柏大舉練兵 全程吼實甚為積極\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl_square/4d00ece7522415702deb35bc208edfd5/2026-11/Gemini_Generated_Image_d376u3d376u3d376.jpg\"/><p>今期跑星期三跑馬地夜賽，方嘉柏素有「黑夜之神」、「谷草王」之譽，皆因練者谷草成績特佳。而上周三谷戰為靚太馬主黃婉曼名下「觀眾之力」建功；剛戰沙田亦再贏「葳莉非凡」，手風正順，周三晚谷戰或能續有頭馬進帳。</p><p>今早方廄參戰馬黃智弘操「北斗福星」(L238)，而廄侶「赤兔再世」(L461)和「喜馬」(K347)均有出大圈快跳，方嘉柏全程緊張地吼實，動態積極。</p><p>按圖睇有關相片：</p><img alt=\"方嘉柏 (左) 全程緊張地吼實三戰馬，動態積極。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/4d45d38d0a759e05c63ef6f7f6750551/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-09_at_10_47_12.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"「喜馬」(K347) 在大圈快跳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/7b69c7d89dd2a556a38d06cff18ecff5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-09_at_10_47_12_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"黃智弘在大圈操「北斗福星」(L238) 。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/3602a57435ccfdc76126c2e10ea551dd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-09_at_10_47_12_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"「赤兔再世」(L461)也有在大圈快跳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/f772331f5252d6c20ff7e5d2b76552be/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-09_at_10_47_13.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"方嘉柏全程緊張地吼實，動態積極。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/990e2d3295cbe4210ba5c7ef82617bef/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-09_at_10_47_14_1_.jpeg\"/><p>陳嘉甜</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.207158+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":272,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T07:08:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:36:08.654607+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:32.961424+00:00","content_hash":"f6fe8ca224bbce82cf5668022ad31f22f16f7ca212ff3c8fc367712884b85514","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}